; sandbox-exec profile that denies all networking (outbound, inbound, and
; loopback bind) while allowing everything else a normal process needs
; (filesystem, process spawn, etc).
;
; Used to prove that GitHubReleaseSource (Packages/SopsGUIKit/Sources/SopsHealth/
; UpstreamVersionSource.swift) — the app's only network call — never reaches the
; network in any test path except the one test that deliberately needs loopback
; to read genuine wire bytes (UpstreamVersionSourceTests.headersOnTheWireAreFixed,
; which is gated to skip rather than fail here — see .enabled(if:) on that test).
;
; Usage: Scripts/test-network-denied.sh
(version 1)
(allow default)
(deny network*)
